# PDU bytes only: no MBAP header, no unit identifier.
# Modbus Application Protocol V1.1b section 6.11, Write Multiple Coils, request example.
# Write ten coils from coil 20 (wire address 0x0013): quantity 10, byte count 2,
# data CD 01. Coil 20 is the least significant bit of the first byte; the 6 padding bits of the last byte are zero.
0F 00 13 00 0A 02 CD 01
